sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Agent UI
    participant H as handleSendMessage
    participant C as Conversation Manager
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant W as Sender Worker
    participant I as Inbox Channel
    participant WS as WebSocket/Webhook

    UI->>H: POST .../messages
    H->>H: 身份、权限、Inbox、附件校验
    H->>C: QueueReply(...)
    C->>DB: INSERT message(status=pending)
    C->>DB: 关联附件并 COMMIT
    C->>WS: 广播新消息快照
    C-->>UI: 返回 pending Message
    loop 每个 scan interval
        W->>DB: 查询 pending outgoing
    end
    W->>I: Send(outbound)
    alt 发送成功
        W->>DB: status=sent
        W->>WS: 广播状态、更新回复时间/SLA
    else 发送失败
        W->>DB: status=failed
        W->>WS: 广播失败状态
    end
